#. ~ Description of "pocketless jumpsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thin, short-sleeved jumpsuit without pockets, similar to those worn by "
"prisoners.  Not very encumbering."
msgstr ""
"Cienki kombinezon z krótkim rękawem, bez kieszeni, podobny do noszonych przez"
" więźniów. Niezbyt krępuje ruchy."

