"They're colored black and printed with a skull pattern.  Works wonders to "
"communicate your happiness on the beach."
msgstr ""
"Jest czarny, z nadrukowanym wzorem czaszek. Doskonale daje wszystkim na plaży"
" znać, jak bardzo jesteś szczęśliwy."

#. ~ Description of "short bikini bottoms"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "A very short pair of bikini bottoms, commonly called a thong."
msgstr "Bardzo skąpy dół od bikini, powszechnie zwany stringami."

#. ~ Description of variant "camo bikini top" of item "bikini top"
#. ~ Description of variant "camo swimsuit" of item "swimsuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "It has a camouflage pattern, perfect for a soldier on beach leave."
msgstr "Ma wzór maskujący, idealny dla żołnierza na przepustce na plaży."

#. ~ Description of variant "skull bikini top" of item "bikini top"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"It's colored black and printed with a skull pattern.  Works wonders to "
