msgstr ""
"Jest czarny, z nadrukowanym wzorem czaszek. Doskonale daje wszystkim na plaży"
" znać, jak bardzo jesteś szczęśliwy."

#. ~ Description of "short bikini top"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A very short bikini top.  It doesn't cover much, but was in fashion before "
"the world ended."
msgstr ""
"Bardzo skąpy stanik bikini. Niewiele zakrywa, ale był modny przed końcem "
"świata."

#. ~ Description of variant "lifeguard swimsuit" of item "swimsuit"
#. ~ Description of variant "lifeguard rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard
#. shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"It's bright red and has a white cross with the word \"Lifeguard\" on the "
"front."
msgstr "Jest jaskrawoczerwony i ma z przodu biały krzyż z napisem „Ratownik”."

#. ~ Description of variant "flag rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"It's printed with an American flag pattern.  You feel as if the flag itself "
"protects your skin."
msgstr ""
"Ma nadruk z amerykańską flagą. Czujesz się, jakby sama flaga chroniła twoją "
"skórę."

#. ~ Description of variant "jungle rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"It has jungle decorations and motifs of animals fighting among themselves."
msgstr "Ma zdobienia w stylu dżungli i motywy walczących ze sobą zwierząt."

#. ~ Description of variant "camo rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "It has a camouflage pattern and outlines your muscles."
msgstr "Ma wzór maskujący i uwydatnia twoje mięśnie."

#. ~ Description of variant "gothic rashguard shirt" of item "rashguard shirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid "It has a jet-black color with dark red decorations.  Looks creepy."
msgstr "Jest kruczoczarny, z ciemnoczerwonymi zdobieniami. Wygląda upiornie."

#. ~ Description of "speedo"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of very short black swim briefs.  Commonly used by male competitive "
"swimmers and bodybuilders."
msgstr ""
"Para bardzo krótkich czarnych kąpielówek. Powszechnie noszone przez pływaków "
"wyczynowych i kulturystów."

#. ~ Description of "swim briefs"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
msgid ""
"A pair of blue swim briefs.  Commonly used by male competitive swimmers."
msgstr ""
"Para niebieskich kąpielówek. Powszechnie noszone przez pływaków wyczynowych."

#. ~ Description of "swim cap"
#: data/json/items/armor/swimming.json
